Context/private/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# READ THIS BEFORE YOU PUSH A FORK
#
# Keep the tracked Context/ templates and AGENTS.md free of personal answers.
# Orientation writes completed profiles, its index, curriculum copies, templates
# and exemplars into Context/private/. Do not force-add that folder.
#
# .gitignore does not protect already tracked files. If an older copy was filled
# in outside Context/private/, review and untrack those files before pushing.
# Moving a file or adding an ignore rule does not remove it from existing history.
# Review every staged file before a push, including teaching files elsewhere in
# the workspace. A downloaded ZIP used locally needs no GitHub remote.
